 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">NUD16_HUMAN Reviewed; 195 AA.</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://www.ra.cs.uni-tuebingen.de/software/KEGGtranslator/EC36164.eref</bp:comment>
